resources.string:
We may collect and process personal data about you including but not limited to:
 • Photographs, videos and other imaging (where your personal identity is clearly identifiable);
 • First name and last name; 
 • Farming data including output and infrastructure;
 • Feedback from you;
 • Social, financial, geographical and biographical information;
 • Address and other contact details.
 • Location data upon your allowing us access to your location in the application

We may use this data for the following purposes:
 • Provide services to you such as agronomy advice, farming materials and access to farming related services such as financing, insurance, and logistics;
 • Facilitate trading with you;
 • Publication on ofi owned channels including websites, social media and prints;
 • Support our sustainability and traceability initiatives;
 • Identify trends in agriculture that will allow us to better operate our business and provide services to you;
 • Market and promote ofi products and corporate activities; 
 • Support research initiatives by our partners to support community collaboration and advancements in the sustainability and traceability areas;
 • Demonstrate our farmer services to potential investors and partners; and
 • Communicate with you and develop and manage our relationships with you and our business partners.
